    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96071" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπορ-ητός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sown corn, growing corn</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1392
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sowing of corn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ς. διακωλύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.6.13
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὀσπρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					8.2.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>seed-time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Hebd.</u>
				4
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σποράτος</span> cod.).</div>
